From: Stained Glass OS <ke7oxh@gmail.com>
Subject: [PATCH] winex11: only the shell takes a reused desktop window id for
 a dead one

0770 made "the desktop's X window is this process's root_window" mean "the
desktop's window is gone: make it again" -- for the shell restarted after a
crash, whose new desktop window got the dead one's id. But SetDesktopWindow
runs once in every thread of every program, and in any program inside the
virtual desktop the desktop's window is its root_window: the desktop's data
was made again in each program's second and later threads. Under the
session's compositor that broke the thread: a window class it registered was
refused (RegisterClass returned STATUS_ACCESS_VIOLATION as its atom), so
.NET's SystemEvents failed -- "Failed to create system events window thread"
-- and MeediOS (and any program making windows on a second thread) failed.

Now only the thread that owns the desktop window -- the shell that took it
over -- takes a reused id for a dead window.

Verified on the installed system (QA VM): a second thread registers a class
and makes a window again; MeediOS starts. Under Xvfb the desktop's window id
is not handed to programs that way, so test/threadclass-gate.sh passes with
or without this; its mutant SG_MUTANT_DESKTOP_REMADE_EVERYWHERE fails only
on the installed system.
---
--- a/dlls/winex11.drv/window.c
+++ b/dlls/winex11.drv/window.c
@@ -2678,7 +2678,17 @@
          * for alive -- the desktop got no window and was never shown */
         if (win && is_virtual_desktop() &&
 #ifndef SG_MUTANT_REUSED_ID_ALIVE
-            (win == root_window ||
+            /* only in the shell that took the desktop over (its own thread):
+             * in any other program the desktop's window is its root_window,
+             * and every thread of it comes here once -- remade there, the
+             * desktop's data broke the thread (a class it registered was
+             * refused: .NET's "Failed to create system events window
+             * thread", MeediOS -- patches/sg/0775) */
+            ((win == root_window
+#ifndef SG_MUTANT_DESKTOP_REMADE_EVERYWHERE
+              && NtUserGetWindowThread( hwnd, NULL ) == GetCurrentThreadId()
+#endif
+             ) ||
 #else
             (0 ||
 #endif
